cff-version: 1.2.0

message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite the associated paper."

title: "CoRC: Collaborative Residual Correction for QoS-Aware Server Selection in MEC"

abstract: >-
  Code and experimental results for CoRC, a post-hoc collaborative
  residual correction method for QoS prediction in multi-access
  edge computing. CoRC uses collaborative evidence to correct
  predictions from existing QoS predictors without modifying their
  internal models. Its effectiveness is evaluated in terms of
  prediction accuracy and downstream server-selection regret.

